Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Many years later
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.38,0:02:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,as he faced the firing squad,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel Aureliano Buendía
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.71,0:02:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,was to remember that distant afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,when his father took him to discover ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,ONE HUNDRED YEARS OF SOLITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía\Nand Úrsula Iguarán were cousins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They had been raised together\Nin the old village
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that their ancestors had transformed into\None of the finest towns in the province.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía, let Úrsula breathe.\NJust hold on a little longer, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!\NLet's celebrate! This party's yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Come on, let's go. Come on!\N-Come on, come on, come on. come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Although their marriage\Nwas to be expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,when they expressed\Ntheir desire to be wed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,their relatives tried to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They feared that after centuries
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:03:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,of their two races being\Nsecularly crossed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,their two healthy products would suffer\Nthe shame of breeding iguanas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They would have been happy\Nhad Úrsula's mother not terrorized her
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,with all sorts of sinister predictions\Nabout their offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey!\NHey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.21,0:06:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she's still tormenting you\Nwith all of her superstitions
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,or that you even listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they're not superstitions.\NThis time what she said was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's more awful than making\Nyou wear all those belts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.25,0:06:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of my mother's cousins\Ngot married and they had a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The child had a shameful deformity\Nhe suffered with his whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A deformity of what sort?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a pig's tail,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,shaped like a corkscrew\Nwith a small tuft of hair on the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would she lie about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She said the poor man bled out
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,after a butcher friend of his\Ncut the tail off with a cleaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine having piglets with you.\NI don't care,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as they're able to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to have pigs for children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,During the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:07:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,he would take care of\Nhis fighting roosters
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and she would embroider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At night,\Nthey would wrestle for several hours
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,in a state of anguished violence
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,that seemed to be a substitute\Nfor the act of making love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía and Úrsula Iguarán\Nlived this way for several months.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought\Nyou'd never come, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet a lot of money on your rooster.\NHe's ready, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.46,0:09:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's here,\Nit's because he's ready, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Magnífico, how are those bets?\N-José, they've got faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Buendía!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How long you've waited to fight me,\Nmy friend, only to be defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.46,0:09:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope you have that stew cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.17,0:09:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,'cause I'm about to kill\Nthat rooster of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Come on! Come on!\N-Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Rip his head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah!\N-Get him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him! Get him! Peck him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.79,0:10:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Peck! Peck! Peck! Peck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Go, rooster! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Peck him! Kill him!\N-Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Peck him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Peck! Peck! Peck! Peck! Peck! Peck! Peck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah! Yeah!\N-Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.21,0:10:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.88,0:10:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Peck! Peck! Peck! Peck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-God dammit!\N-Woo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's how you fucking peck!\N-Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.75,0:10:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you fight! Rooster! Rooster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Rooster! Rooster! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my friend… such is life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a fine animal. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Careful, he's a killer.\N-Killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.25,0:11:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buendía!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.42,0:11:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, maybe that fighting cock
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,can finally do your wife a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home and find a weapon\N'cause I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is bad.\N-Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-It was amazing.\N-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He just passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you birth iguanas,\Nthen we'll raise iguanas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.67,0:13:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But there'll be no more killings\Nin this town because of the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,As the senior officials\Nof this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,the Mayor and this humble servant
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,conclude that the unfortunate demise\Nof one Prudencio Aguilar
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.46,0:15:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,was, in fact, the result of\Na legitimate duel of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, José Arcadio Buendía,\Nan honorable young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,is acquitted on all counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.21,0:15:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-No!\N-That's not justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is an unfair ruling!\N-Enough! Show some decorum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's unjust!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,God bless you. Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend, the thing\Nthat you need to do now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:16:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,is to come with me\Nand drink your sorrows away. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you even doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You had it coming, and you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Each time you come back here,\NI'm gonna kill you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía\Ndid not dare throw his spear,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and Prudencio Aguilar did not go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.67,0:18:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand me the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They never felt\Nat peace after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They were tormented\Nby the immense desolation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,with which the dead man\Nhad looked at them that night…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the deep nostalgia\Nwith which he regarded the living…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,…the anxiety with which\Nhe searched through the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,looking for some water\Nto soak the plug for his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula was so moved when she saw\Nthe dead man uncovering pots on the stove,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that she began to place water\Nbowls all over the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you just leave us alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You win, Prudencio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll move far away from here\Nso you can find some peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll never come back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where will we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll cross the mountains\Nuntil we reach the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.33,0:20:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd.\NNo one's ever journeyed that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we find somewhere new
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,where the fears of our ancestors\Ncan't torment us any longer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and where you and I can\Nlove each other freely
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.75,0:20:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and raise a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.67,0:20:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.92,0:21:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter where you run,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you will never be able to\Nescape your true destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.08,0:22:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,\Noff we go, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.75,0:22:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When they left to undertake\Nthe crossing of the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.83,0:22:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,several of José Arcadio Buendía's friends,\Nyoung men like himself, followed suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,thrilled by the adventure of it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.33,0:22:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They dismantled their homes,\Npacked up their wives and children,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and headed towards the land\Nthat no one had promised them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.71,0:23:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.75,0:23:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Hanged Man…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.08,0:23:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is that jug I promised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Has she read the cards to you?\N-Of course, for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.25,0:23:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.04,0:25:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just breathe out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.17,0:25:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ooh.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.21,0:25:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a strong push!\NOne last push, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:25:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Push! Here it comes!\NHere it comes! Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.92,0:26:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,With her stomach ravaged by\Nmonkey meat and snake stew,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.96,0:26:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula gave birth to a boy\Nwith all his human body parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.13,0:27:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.75,0:27:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!\NWhoa! Whoa! Whoa! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.25,0:27:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy! Easy, boy! Easy! Easy! Easy! Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.92,0:27:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.21,0:27:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.54,0:27:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.58,0:27:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.21,0:27:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Geri!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.04,0:28:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.\NWe'll be at the ocean in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.96,0:28:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After almost\Ntwo years of traveling,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.46,0:28:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,they became the first mortals to witness\Nthe western slopes of the mountain range.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.25,0:29:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,From the cloudy summit,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.83,0:29:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,they saw the immense aquatic expanse\Nof the great swamp
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.33,0:29:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,stretching toward\Nthe other side of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.13,0:29:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But they never found the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.54,0:29:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-You said there'd be an ocean!\N-Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.63,0:29:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Where is it?!\N-Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.75,0:29:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Gerineldo!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.83,0:29:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It has got to be just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.08,0:30:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.75,0:30:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.92,0:30:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.38,0:30:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been moving in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.42,0:30:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no idea where we are\Nor where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.42,0:30:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find a way there by land.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.92,0:30:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.79,0:31:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,after several months of\Naimlessly wandering through the swamp,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.79,0:31:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,they set up camp\Non the banks of a stony river
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.50,0:31:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,whose waters resembled\Na frozen torrent of glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.54,0:31:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This great swamp must end somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.67,0:31:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find a way out of this place
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.13,0:31:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and then we'll\Nreach the ocean once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.21,0:31:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.33,0:31:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time for you\Nto finally open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.42,0:31:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you stopped and looked around lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.63,0:32:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía had\Na dream that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.58,0:32:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He dreamt that a bustling city\Nrose up in that very place
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.29,0:32:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,full of houses with mirror walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.67,0:33:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He asked what the city was called,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.58,0:33:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and they answered with a name\Nhe had never heard before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.21,0:33:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A name that had no meaning at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.58,0:33:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but that echoed supernaturally\Nin his dream…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.54,0:33:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.33,0:33:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.46,0:33:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.33,0:33:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gerineldo…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.83,0:33:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we haven't found the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.50,0:33:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,or a place for us to settle either…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.33,0:34:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but to keep looking for it is absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.92,0:34:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of you here is free\Nto choose your own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.92,0:34:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're going to be staying right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.17,0:34:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll build what we always envisioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.29,0:34:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,a home for our children,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.33,0:34:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,where every person can decide\Nhow they want to live and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.75,0:34:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And this town of ours…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.33,0:34:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,shall be called Macondo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.75,0:34:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the harvest?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.50,0:34:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio, where are your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.08,0:34:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Macondo grew into\Na village of 20 clay and reed houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.33,0:34:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They stood on the bank of a river
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.50,0:34:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,whose clear water ran\Nalong a bed of polished stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.21,0:35:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Enormous, beautiful, white stones\Nlike prehistoric eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.79,0:35:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hi, Papa!\N-Hey, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.96,0:35:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The world was so recent,\Nthat many things lacked names,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.21,0:35:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and the only way to refer\Nto them was by pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.50,0:35:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.54,0:35:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, give this bowl of corozos\Nto your mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.88,0:35:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ask her if she can\Nmake you some juice. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.13,0:35:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.42,0:35:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía\Nhad arranged the houses in such a way
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.83,0:35:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,that each of them could access the river\Nand draw water with the same effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.83,0:35:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He laid out the streets so thoughtfully
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.13,0:35:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,that no one house got more sun\Nthan another, even on the hottest of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.63,0:35:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hi, mama.\N-Are you naked again?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.54,0:36:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any shame?\NWhere did you get these corozos?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.67,0:36:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Do you want juice?\N-Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.08,0:36:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.33,0:36:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.25,0:36:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.38,0:36:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where will it live?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.29,0:36:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.46,0:36:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdie will live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.75,0:36:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the course\Nof the following years,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.13,0:36:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía would fill each home
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.33,0:36:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,with troupials, canaries,\Nbee-eaters and redbreasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.04,0:37:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The daily chorus of birds\Nbecame so distressing
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.38,0:37:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,that Úrsula would plug\Nher ears with beeswax…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.58,0:37:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mama.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.54,0:37:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,…to keep herself from losing\Nall sense of reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.96,0:37:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Leave it over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.38,0:37:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.50,0:37:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.21,0:37:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.08,0:37:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.83,0:37:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how 'bout we try it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.13,0:37:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.58,0:37:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.13,0:37:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.17,0:38:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.75,0:38:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.58,0:38:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey! Hey!\N-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.29,0:39:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who, exactly, are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.00,0:39:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Melquiades.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.79,0:39:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.29,0:39:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fair has traveled far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.88,0:39:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And how did you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.50,0:39:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.29,0:39:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been crossing\Nthe swamp for a while now
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.33,0:39:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and were drawn by their singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.08,0:39:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.96,0:39:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.00,0:40:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the people of Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.25,0:40:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.54,0:40:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear friends and folks,\Nwe've brought to these faraway lands
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.29,0:40:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the eighth wonder\Nof the wisest alchemists of Macedonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.83,0:40:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If any one of you wishes\Nto witness firsthand
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.79,0:40:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,this extraordinary invention,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.21,0:40:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,come with me please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.63,0:40:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.00,0:40:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Today you shall see\Nhow things come to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.88,0:40:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need to do is awaken their spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.67,0:41:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.83,0:41:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all witchcraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.96,0:41:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.33,0:41:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just science.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.46,0:41:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like to see more,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.21,0:41:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you're invited to join us at our fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.67,0:41:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Music! Please, brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.38,0:42:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio Buendía,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.21,0:42:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,whose unbridled imagination
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.25,0:42:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,always went beyond\Nthe genius of nature, miracles, and magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.42,0:42:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,thought it might be possible\Nto benefit from that useless invention
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.46,0:42:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and extract gold\Nfrom the bowels of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.29,0:42:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not trading them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.58,0:42:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But you saw! Those things drag metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.67,0:42:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And these goats feed our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.83,0:42:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how much gold we could get?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.88,0:42:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need gold in Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.08,0:42:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My love,\NMacondo won't stay like this forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.96,0:42:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to look to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.46,0:43:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't sell you\Nthe magnets for that purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.54,0:43:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your logic is sound, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.04,0:43:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But paradoxically,\Nthey don't attract precious metals.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.71,0:44:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they may not work\Nwith smaller quantities,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.83,0:44:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but they'll surely help us unearth\Nall of those bigger rocks
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.25,0:44:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,or large heaps of treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.75,0:44:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can pay you for those.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.67,0:44:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't sell the magnets to you,\Nnot for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.29,0:44:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There'd be nothing to gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.75,0:44:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me try and prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.17,0:44:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll lose nothing, Melquiades.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.25,0:44:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.00,0:44:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I like your enthusiasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.63,0:45:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gerineldo, what you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.21,0:45:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched this area.\NWe need to look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.21,0:45:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You could've\Ntold me that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.04,0:45:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you tell?\NYou're an idiot. Just stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.21,0:45:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'll go this way.\N-Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.96,0:45:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.38,0:45:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.67,0:45:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.50,0:45:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a week already,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.58,0:45:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and all we've been able\Nto find so far are bones and bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.63,0:47:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So what about all the gold\Nyou said you would find?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.46,0:47:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to\Nhave to get our goats back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.33,0:47:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're no longer ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.67,0:47:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you better go face\Nthat lying, cheating gypsy, or I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.63,0:47:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to give away\Nany of our animals, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.25,0:47:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.25,0:47:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.54,0:47:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.00,0:47:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.50,0:47:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife\Nwants nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.33,0:48:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,At least you saw it with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.96,0:48:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Experience… is everything in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.21,0:48:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to take your goats.\NThey're waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.00,0:48:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Melquiades…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.63,0:48:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,may I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.92,0:48:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.38,0:48:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you manage crossing\Nthose swamps out there
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.92,0:48:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,without losing your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.58,0:48:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a long and difficult journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.38,0:48:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but we were guided the whole time\Nby our instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.50,0:48:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What instruments?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.21,0:48:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.00,0:48:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. This is an astrolabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.54,0:49:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For centuries,\Nhumans have tried scrutinizing the skies
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.38,0:49:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to help them decipher the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.54,0:49:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.38,0:49:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Science is eliminating distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.58,0:49:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. This is a compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.83,0:49:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And a sextant.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.00,0:49:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long\Nbefore man will be able to see
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.33,0:49:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,what is happening anywhere on Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.29,0:49:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,without ever leaving his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.50,0:49:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,These are Portuguese maps. Ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.21,0:49:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.38,0:49:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Those tools will help you interpret them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.46,0:49:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.67,0:49:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Melquiades.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.29,0:49:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,On that day,\NJosé Arcadio Buendía was certain
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.83,0:49:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that this would be the beginning\Nof a great friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.13,0:50:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He spent entire nights carefully observing\Nthe course of the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.88,0:50:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he became an expert
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.58,0:50:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,in the use and handling\Nof his instruments,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.42,0:50:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,he understood the notion of space,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.71,0:50:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,thus allowing him\Nto navigate unknown seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.96,0:50:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,visit uninhabited territories,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.38,0:50:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and to establish relationships\Nwith the most incredible beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.75,0:50:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know\Nwhat you do all day with those maps,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.71,0:50:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but you have to do it somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.50,0:50:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to understand where Macondo is
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.29,0:50:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so we can finally find\Na path to civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.29,0:50:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the answer to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.21,0:50:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Macondo is here,\Nand you're up on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.17,0:50:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,José Arcadio, it's dinnertime!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.25,0:51:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to wash those hands first\Nbecause they're covered in dirt. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.71,0:51:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.50,0:51:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.33,0:52:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This galleon must be 200 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.38,0:53:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.54,0:53:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's gotta be close?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.67,0:53:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.71,0:53:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This discovery shook\NJosé Arcadio Buendía's spirit to its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.17,0:53:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He considered it a mockery of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.21,0:53:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,to have searched for the sea\Nwithout finding it,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.71,0:53:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,paying with countless sacrifices,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.13,0:53:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,only to now stumble upon it\Nwithout looking at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.96,0:54:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We gave up on the of verge\Nof finding the sea, Úrsula.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.79,0:54:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Macondo is surrounded by water.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.08,0:54:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We took several measurements,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.63,0:54:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but we still need more\Nin order to complete the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.96,0:54:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go on another expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.08,0:54:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We must communicate\Nwith the rest of world.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.00,0:54:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave us alone anymore, José.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.54,0:54:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see we need you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.04,0:55:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-José Arcadio.\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.92,0:55:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.54,0:55:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.42,0:55:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.58,0:55:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.63,0:55:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crying. I hear it inside the womb.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.46,0:55:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Matilde, the hot rags! Hurry up!\N-I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.42,0:56:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.29,0:56:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathe. Just breathe, Úrsula!\NThat's it. Take deep breaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.17,0:56:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push.\NDon't push, don't push! Just breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.38,0:56:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula shuddered,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.75,0:56:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,for she was certain\Nthat the deep bellowing inside of her
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.88,0:56:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,was the first indication\Nof the dreaded pig tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.92,0:56:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And she begged God\Nto let the creature die in her womb.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.54,0:56:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it! You can do it!\NÚrsula, it's coming! It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.38,0:56:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes, Úrsula!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.46,0:56:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, come on!\NOne more push! One more! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.71,0:56:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.71,0:56:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.54,0:56:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.25,0:56:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano was\Nthe first human being born in Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.08,0:56:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He was born with his eyes open,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.25,0:57:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,examining the world\Nwith an indifferent curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.21,0:57:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula had forgotten\Nall about the intensity of that look,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.17,0:57:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,until one afternoon many years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.42,0:57:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,when Aureliano Buendía\Nhad his first premonition.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.29,0:57:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, the pot is gonna fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.92,0:57:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The pot's fine, Aureliano.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.63,0:57:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he became aware\Nof his premonitions,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.46,0:57:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel Aureliano Buendía thought one day,\Nhis death would announce itself
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.42,0:57:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,with a clear,\Nunmistakable, and irrevocable sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.29,0:57:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But just moments before his death…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.17,0:58:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the sign had yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.21,0:58:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,BASED ON THE NOVEL\NBY GABRIEL GARCÍA MÁRQUEZ
